[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだ！\u3000ねえ、新曲聞いてみない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! Hey, want to hear the new song?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうね。どういう形になるにせよ、\n次のライブで披露するんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sure. Whatever form the show ends up taking, it's what we'll be performing next time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほら、あんたも！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, you too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う、うむ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "楽しくていい曲だね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's such a fun song!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "年末のライブに向けた曲だけあって、\n賑やかな曲調でござるな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's a lively piece, befitting a year-end live show."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふん、さすが社長。なかなかいい仕事するじゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heh, not bad at all. Looks like our president's got some real talent."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "戻りましたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm back."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、社長！\nいきなり出て行くからびっくりしちゃったよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, you're back! You took off so suddenly, you gave me a scare!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いったいなんの用だったの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So what was all that about?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "改めて話をしてきましたわ。フェスの運営責任者と、\nそしてランターナ学園の理事長にも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I had a proper conversation with the festival's organizers—and with the chairman of Lantarna Academy as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "学園の……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The academy...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "現在は長期休暇中……特に年末年始は部活動なども\nすべて休み。この学園は無人の「箱」となります",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "During the long holiday break, especially over the new year, all club activities are suspended. The academy becomes an empty shell."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まさか……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You can't mean...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここ、ランターナ学園を\nカウントダウンフェスの会場とします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We will be using Lantarna Academy itself as the venue for the Countdown Festival!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおおおおおっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ohhhhh!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "学園の校庭を臨時のライブ会場に改装し、\nそこに観客を入れる計画で各所進行中ですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The plan is to convert the school grounds into a temporary live venue and open it to an audience. All parties are already in motion."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、確かに広さは十分だけど……\nいきなりそんなことできるの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I mean, there's certainly enough space... but can you actually pull that off on such short notice?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろん、課題は山積みですわ。会場の設営以外にも、\nフードやドリンクの手配、近隣住民との交渉など……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There are countless challenges ahead, of course. Beyond the venue setup, there's food and drinks to arrange, negotiations with nearby residents..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "元々のスタッフだけでは手が足りませんから、\n臨時アルバイトを雇う予定ではありますが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The existing staff won't be enough, so we're planning to bring on temporary help as well..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "学園の生徒からも、「課外活動」という名目で\n協力者を募ってもよい、と許可を得ています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And the academy has given us permission to recruit students under the name of 'extracurricular activities.'"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、レスナちゃんたちにも声かけてみようよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then let's ask Resna and the others to help!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それならば錬金術の力も借りられないだろうか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Could we perhaps also call upon the power of alchemy?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キューンたちにも手伝ってもらいましょ。\n同じ参加者なんだし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's get Quinn and the others involved too. They are participants, after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、やる気ですわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, I love the enthusiasm."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本番に向けてのレッスンもありますが、\n可能な範囲で、それぞれできることをやりましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We still have rehearsals leading up to the show, but let's each do what we can within our means."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "三人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Group"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "不要",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "不要",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]